text = PackedStringArray("hey, babe\\ni\'m gonna go try to find the bathroom.", ". . . okay", ". . .", "Hey, how are you doing?", "uhhh, i am doing well.", ". . . how are [i]you[/i] doing on this evening?", "[color=969696]why am i so bad at speaking??????[/color]", "I\'m doing alright.", "Do you come here often?", ". . . not since [b]2019[/b]", "Oh, okay.", "this place is [i]really cool[/i]", "[b]Yeah[/b], it is.", "Do you play any instruments?", ". . . ", "uhhhh, no. I mean . . . ", "-ye-yes, technically, i play bass, but only really for myself.", "i don\'t play in front of anyone or anything . . .", "That is so valid.", "d-do you play any instruments?", "I do. I play guitar.", "I\'m actually going to be playing it pretty soon.", "[i]You[/i] are performing tonight?", "Yeah.", "Oh! Wow, I guess I just-", "I guess I forgot that y\'all are people too.", "Yep, just normal people.", "[i][color=969696]You see your genderqueer fucktoy returning.[/color][/i]", "well, anyways, i-i hope you have a good evening.", "You the same.", "Hey, babe. Are you doing alright? You look shaken.", "Yeah", "I am alright.")
